{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/457729-homebrew-stygian-lineage-void-filled-and-crazy","id":457729,"title":"[Homebrew] Stygian Lineage: Void-filled and Crazy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-25T21:29:07-07:00","id":457729,"title":"[Homebrew] Stygian Lineage: Void-filled and Crazy","content":"Hello everyone, this is my first time posting homebrew of any kind on this forum, and I wanted your opinions on my homebrew Lineage, the Stygians. For this lineage, I wanted to make something entirely alien in nature, both to humans and Prometheans.<br /> <br /> <b>Quick Summary</b><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Stygians possess an excess of the <b>Void</b> humour (in truth, this means that all their humours are dampened). This makes them erratic, inhuman, and perpetually hungry. They begin at <b>Humanity 5</b> instead of 7 to reflect this nature. They may only select <b>Centimanus</b> as their Refinement unless they have dots in the <b>Whispers of Humanity</b> merit (more dots opens up more refinements). Their Bewstowment, <b>Cthonic Void</b>, allows them to briefly ignore all need for air, as well as allowing them to ingest caustics for reduced damage. Their Mockery, <b>Death Stalkers</b>, hunt Prometheans with a method called <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persistence_hunting\" target=\"_blank\">persistence hunting</a>, chasing a Promethean from the edge of Azothic Radiance until it collapses of exhaustion.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The full writeup can be found at <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HYN6Hs3MKqQKidQACCHnNY8IJ_beWgyVQ507zCRLu5M/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">this google drive link here</a>. Please give me your feedback, and tell me what you think!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}